---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Harry Sivasambu"
  description="Cloud engineer portfolio, projects, and writing."
>
  <section id="about" class="card" style="padding: 22px;">
    <p style="margin: 0; color: var(--muted);">
      Hi, I'm Harry, a Technical Project Manager from Toronto, Canada. I design and deliver systems that sit at the intersection of clinical workflows, real-time communication, and cloud infrastructure.
      My focus is turning complex, high-stakes environments into reliable, scalable solutions.
    </p>
    <p style="margin: 10px 0 0; color: var(--muted);">
      I also love the NBA, Formula 1, travelling the world, and hunting down the best local street food in every city I visit.
    </p>
    <p style="margin: 10px 0 0; color: var(--muted);">
      Explore the projects and posts below to see how I work, what I learn, and how I keep pace with modern platforms.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="featured-work" style="margin-top: 28px;">
    <h2 style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 22px;">Featured Work</h2>
    <div class="card" style="display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: center;">
      <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 0;">
        <h3 style="margin: 0 0 8px;">Clinical Alert Triage Assistant</h3>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: var(--muted);">
          A simulated clinical alert triage system built around one constraint: AI explains alerts, rules and humans decide.
        </p>
        <ul style="margin: 0 0 12px; padding-left: 18px; color: var(--muted);">
          <li>Designed a rules engine as the severity floor — the LLM cannot downgrade a critical alert or override deterministic thresholds</li>
          <li>Built a structured explainability standard requiring summary, key factors, routing rationale, uncertainty, rule trace, and verification guidance</li>
          <li>Implemented fallback-to-rules-only mode, human override flow, feedback capture, and a full audit log for every decision</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/blog/clinical-alert-triage">Read write-up →</a>
      </div>
      <a href="/blog/clinical-alert-triage" style="width: 45%; flex-shrink: 0; display: block;">
        <img
          src="/images/alert-triaging/alerts_Table.jpg"
          alt="Clinical alert triage alerts table"
          style="width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; display: block;"
        />
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="other-projects" style="margin-top: 28px;">
    <h2 style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 22px;">Other Projects</h2>
    <div class="card" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
      <h3 style="margin: 0 0 6px; color: var(--accent);">Patient Logger App</h3>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: var(--muted);">
        A full-stack clinical task tracking application with multi-tenant data isolation, role-based access control, and a containerized stack.
      </p>
      <a href="/blog/patient-logger">Read write-up →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3 style="margin: 0 0 6px; color: var(--accent);">AWS Cloud Resume Challenge</h3>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: var(--muted);">
        Imported a production-style AWS stack into Terraform, validated zero-drift, and automated deploys.
      </p>
      <a href="/blog/cloud-resume-challenge">Read write-up →</a>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section id="experience" style="margin-top: 28px;">
    <h2 style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 22px;">Real-World Experience</h2>
    <div class="card">
      <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 500;">What I've delivered in production:</p>
      <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; color: var(--muted);">
        <li>Led implementations across multiple hospital sites with complex integration requirements</li>
        <li>Worked on systems involving real-time communication, alert routing, and clinical workflows</li>
        <li>Coordinated across technical teams, vendors, and frontline healthcare staff</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="current-focus" style="margin-top: 28px;">
    <h2 style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 22px;">Current Focus</h2>
    <div class="card">
      <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; color: var(--muted);">
        <li>Deepening system design and cloud architecture skills</li>
        <li>Building production-style applications that reflect real-world constraints</li>
        <li>Exploring how AI systems integrate into operational workflows</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" style="margin-top: 28px;">
    <div class="card" style="padding: 22px;">
      <p style="margin: 0 0 12px; color: var(--muted);">
        If you're working on complex systems where reliability and real-world constraints matter, let's connect.
      </p>
      <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 18px;">
        <li><a href="https://github.com/hsivasambu">Github</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/hsivasambu/">LinkedIn</a></li>
        <li><a href="mailto:h.sivasambu@gmail.com">Email</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
